    <div class="bgrid">
      <div class="bcard rv"><div class="bicon" style="background:#ede4ff">⚡</div><div class="bstat">8s</div><h3>Faster response rates</h3><p>Median first reply under 8 seconds, 24/7 — across Instagram, WhatsApp, email and chat. No more “we’ll get back in 2 business days.”</p></div>
